OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright spells and mostly dry in
OL,6,Fthe morning. Becoming cloudy for all
OL,7,Fin the afternoon with outbreaks of
OL,8,Frain over northwestern parts, turning
OL,9,Foccasionally heavy. Staying dry in the
OL,10,Fsoutheast until later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining cloudy through the
OL,13,Fevening as persistent rain spreads
OL,14,Fsoutheast to all parts, turning heavy
OL,15,Fat times. This continues east
OL,16,Fovernight, largely clear by dawn to
OL,17,Fallow some clear spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
