OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FBright spells and a
OL,6,Fscattering of showers at first.
OL,7,FBecoming dry through the afternoon
OL,8,Fwith increasing bright or sunny spells.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,11,Fstart Thursday, then a further band of
OL,12,Fcloud and rain passes southeast
OL,13,Fthrough the evening. Bright spells and
OL,14,Fa few showers Friday. Rain or showers
OL,15,Fon Saturday.
